# basePath DesignInverter
// Inverter

::Intro
@trigger    OnDesignSetupComplete
$set temp:hintGiven = 0
{@PAL} This chip has both HI and LO constants. So you can use the Input just to control Gates!

::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  Hint: Check the Verification Table: When A is HI, let LO pass to X.\nWhen A is LO, let HI pass to X.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  Hint: You’ll need two gates, both controlled by A.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 2
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 2
    {@PAL}  Hint: Alternate N and P type to ensure no unstable signals leak backwards.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 0
$endif